  "worked_solution": "| ${x}_{1}$ | **$1$** | **$2$** | **$3$** | **$4$** | **$5$** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${x}_{2}$ | **$10$** | **$25$** | **$32$** | **$42$** | **$15$** |\n| $y$ | $0$ | $-5$ | $-2$ | $2$ | $7$ |\n\nThe coefficients of the plane \n\n$$\ny={\\beta }_{1}{x}_{1}+{\\beta }_{2}{x}_{2}\n$$\n\nthat best fits the data can be found as the least-squares solution $\\overset{^}{\\beta }$ to the system \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{X}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 10 \\\\ 2 & 25 \\\\ 3 & 32 \\\\ 4 & 42 \\\\ 5 & 15\\end{aligned}]}}\\overset{\\beta }{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}{\\beta }_{1} \\\\ {\\beta }_{2}\\end{aligned}]}} & =\\overset{y}{\\overset{⏞}{[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ -5 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]}},\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $X$ is the design matrix, $\\beta $ is the parameter vector, and $y$ is the observation vector.",
